$0(){return A.lk(this.a,"# Frolf \u2014 looping acid bass; hold the Pedal to play a lead over it.\nname Frolf \ud83e\udd4f\n\n# The sequence drives both voices \u2014 its pitch CV is fanned out by a mult.\nfilter MidiSequencer seq1\nknob seq1 bpm 130.0\nknob seq1 division 4\nknob seq1 gate_length 0.5\nknob seq1 notes C2 . C3 Eb2 . G2 Bb2 G2\n\nfilter Copy2Cv pitchsplit\npatch seq1 out_cv -> pitchsplit in_cv\n\n# --- BASS: a saw plucked through a resonant filter (the acid bed). One snappy\n# envelope drives both the filter cutoff and the amp, so every note pews. ---\nfilter ClassicOscillator vco1\nknob vco1 freq 440.0\nknob vco1 waveform 2\npatch pitchsplit out_cv_a -> vco1 in_pitch_cv\n\nfilter ADSR env1\nknob env1 attack 0.004\nknob env1 decay 0.16\nknob env1 sustain 0.25\nknob env1 release 0.1\npatch seq1 out_gate -> env1 in_gate\n\nfilter Copy2Cv envsplit\npatch env1 out_cv -> envsplit in_cv\n\nfilter SVF vcf1\nknob vcf1 cutoff 200.0\nknob vcf1 resonance 0.85\nknob vcf1 mode 0\npatch envsplit out_cv_a -> vcf1 in_cutoff_cv\n\nfilter Volume vca1\nknob vca1 volume 0.6\npatch envsplit out_cv_b -> vca1 in_gain_cv\npatch vco1 out_pcm -> vcf1 in_pcm\npatch vcf1 out_pcm -> vca1 in_pcm\n\n# --- LEAD: a bright square an octave up, PLAYED BY THE PEDAL. Hold the pedal\n# to sing the line over the bass; its mode/time reshape the lead (Gate\n# sustains, Linear/Exp decay plucks, Bounce stutters). ---\nfilter ClassicOscillator lead1\nknob lead1 freq 880.0\nknob lead1 waveform 1\npatch pitchsplit out_cv_b -> lead1 in_pitch_cv\n\nfilter Pedal pedal1\nknob pedal1 mode 0          # Gate \u2014 hold to sustain the lead\nknob pedal1 time 0.25\n\nfilter Volume leadvca\nknob leadvca volume 0.7\npatch lead1 out_pcm -> leadvca in_pcm\npatch pedal1 out_cv -> leadvca in_gain_cv\n\n# --- Mix bass + lead, echo, master limiter. ---\nfilter Mix2Pcm mix1\nknob mix1 normalize false\npatch vca1 out_pcm -> mix1 in_pcm_a\npatch leadvca out_pcm -> mix1 in_pcm_b\n\nfilter Delay dly1\nknob dly1 time 0.26\nknob dly1 feedback 0.3\nknob dly1 mix 0.28\npatch mix1 out_pcm -> dly1 in_pcm\n\nfilter Limiter lim1\nknob lim1 ceiling 0.9\npatch dly1 out_pcm -> lim1 in_pcm\noutput lim1 out_pcm\n\npanel knob pedal1 pedal\npanel knob pedal1 mode\npanel knob pedal1 time\npanel knob vcf1 cutoff\npanel knob seq1 bpm\n\n"+A.iC())},
