$0(){return A.lk(this.a,"# Kitchen Sink \u2014 a clean acid voice + sub, FX bus, and a pedal stab.\nname Kitchen Sink \ud83e\ude9b\n\n# Sequencer drives pitch + gate; the pitch CV is fanned out to every voice.\nfilter MidiSequencer seq\nknob seq bpm 124.0\nknob seq division 4\nknob seq gate_length 0.55\nknob seq notes C2 . Eb2 G2 . Bb2 C3 G2\n\nfilter Copy2Cv pitch\npatch seq out_cv -> pitch in_cv\nfilter Copy2Cv pitch2\npatch pitch out_cv_b -> pitch2 in_cv\n\n# LEAD: a saw plucked through a resonant SVF by one snappy envelope (cutoff + amp).\nfilter ClassicOscillator lead\nknob lead freq 440.0\nknob lead waveform 2\npatch pitch out_cv_a -> lead in_pitch_cv\n\nfilter ADSR env\nknob env attack 0.005\nknob env decay 0.18\nknob env sustain 0.3\nknob env release 0.12\npatch seq out_gate -> env in_gate\n\nfilter Copy2Cv envf\npatch env out_cv -> envf in_cv\n\nfilter SVF vcf\nknob vcf cutoff 300.0\nknob vcf resonance 0.8\nknob vcf mode 0\npatch envf out_cv_a -> vcf in_cutoff_cv\n\nfilter Volume lvca\npatch envf out_cv_b -> lvca in_gain_cv\npatch lead out_pcm -> vcf in_pcm\npatch vcf out_pcm -> lvca in_pcm\n\n# SUB: a sine two octaves down, tracking the same pitch CV. Steady weight.\nfilter ClassicOscillator sub\nknob sub freq 110.0\nknob sub waveform 0\npatch pitch2 out_cv_a -> sub in_pitch_cv\nfilter Volume svol\nknob svol volume 0.5\npatch sub out_pcm -> svol in_pcm\n\n# Blend the voices, then run the FX bus.\nfilter Mix2Pcm voices\nknob voices normalize false\npatch lvca out_pcm -> voices in_pcm_a\npatch svol out_pcm -> voices in_pcm_b\n\nfilter Distortion drive\nknob drive drive 2.4\nknob drive mix 0.6\npatch voices out_pcm -> drive in_pcm\n\nfilter Bitcrusher crush\nknob crush target_rate 12000.0\nknob crush bit_depth 8\nknob crush mix 0.35\npatch drive out_pcm -> crush in_pcm\n\nfilter BandPass shape\nknob shape low_cutoff 120.0\nknob shape high_cutoff 6000.0\npatch crush out_pcm -> shape in_pcm\n\nfilter Delay echo\nknob echo time 0.27\nknob echo feedback 0.38\nknob echo mix 0.28\npatch shape out_pcm -> echo in_pcm\n\n# Master mixer leaves a free channel for the pedal stab; the limiter holds it all.\nfilter Mix2Pcm master\nknob master normalize false\npatch echo out_pcm -> master in_pcm_a\n\nfilter Limiter lim\nknob lim ceiling 0.9\npatch master out_pcm -> lim in_pcm\noutput lim out_pcm\n\n# PEDAL STAB: a bright square an octave up, high-passed; hold the pedal to punch\n# it in over the groove (into the master's free channel).\nfilter ClassicOscillator stab\nknob stab freq 660.0\nknob stab waveform 1\npatch pitch2 out_cv_b -> stab in_pitch_cv\nfilter HighPass stabhp\nknob stabhp cutoff 1200.0\npatch stab out_pcm -> stabhp in_pcm\nfilter Volume stabvca\nknob stabvca volume 0.7\npatch stabhp out_pcm -> stabvca in_pcm\nfilter Pedal pedal\nknob pedal mode 0\nknob pedal time 0.3\npatch pedal out_cv -> stabvca in_gain_cv\npatch stabvca out_pcm -> master in_pcm_b\n\npanel knob vcf cutoff\npanel knob vcf resonance\npanel knob seq bpm\npanel knob pedal pedal\npanel knob pedal mode\npanel knob echo mix\n\n"+A.iC())},
